        "title": "fix(qqbot): clear voice send timeouts after delivery settles",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where QQBot voice delivery timeout timers could remain scheduled after the delivery promise had already settled.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe QQBot voice send paths now use a shared race helper that clears the timer in a `finally` block after the send operation settles. This keeps the existing timeout behavior and late-delivery handling while avoiding stale timers in successful or failed sends.\n\nThis is an AI-assisted contribution prepared for Alix-007.\n\n## User Impact\n\nQQBot voice sends keep the same user-visible timeout behavior without leaving unnecessary timers behind after delivery completes.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/qqbot/src/engine/messaging/race-with-timeout.test.ts`\n- Result: 1 test file passed, 1 test passed.\n- `git diff --check HEAD^ HEAD --`\n- Result: passed.\n",
